{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6329","title":"POCO Carnival 2026 Celebrates Eight Years of Bold Innovation, From 8 to ∞","desc":"Today, POCO is thrilled to announce the return of its biggest annual celebration, POCO Carnival 2026, running from August 7 to August 23. Themed \"From 8 to ∞\", this year's Carnival marks POCO's eighth anniversary.","view_cnt":"3347","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1785915633","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/555_operatorx_operatorx_opx/05/08/2026/5a7d8076aa04780422c86d87cd399a4e.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, August 7, 2026 — \u003c/strong\u003eToday, POCO is thrilled to announce the return of its biggest annual celebration, POCO Carnival 2026, running from August 7 to August 23.¹ Themed \"From 8 to ∞\", this year's Carnival marks POCO's eighth anniversary. It is not only a celebration of the achievements of the past eight years, but also a new starting point — inviting fans worldwide to embrace the infinite possibilities of POCO's future together. Packed with exclusive promotions and interactive fan activities, POCO Carnival 2026 is the ultimate opportunity for users to experience POCO's bold technology at unbeatable value.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/779_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/05/08/2026/29d7a6f6d243130da0c3debedcb5598d.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInfinite Performance, Exceptional Deals\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDriven by its mission to deliver extreme performance and value, POCO has spent the past eight years making cutting-edge innovation accessible to even more tech enthusiasts worldwide. To celebrate this milestone, POCO Carnival 2026 brings exclusive offers to fans around the globe, making the anniversary celebration even more rewarding. Throughout the Carnival period, promotions will be available on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com \u003c/a\u003eand various e-commerce platforms, including Shopee, Amazon, Lazada, AliExpress, and Mercado Libre.² For even more exclusive deals on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com\u003c/a\u003e, fans can unlock special savings by applying the code POCO8TH at checkout.³ Featured products include:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOCO F8 Ultra: \u003c/strong\u003eA technology-leading flagship that sets a new benchmark for flagship innovation. Armed with the Snapdragon® 8 Elite Gen 5 and VisionBoost D8 chipsets, it delivers unmatched smoothness across gaming and multitasking. Elevating the flagship experience, POCO F8 Ultra introduces a revolutionary 2.1-channel architecture with Sound by Bose technology, ushering in a new era of mobile acoustics, while POCO's first-ever 50MP 5x periscope telephoto lens unlocks pro-level photography capabilities.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOCO F8 Pro:\u003c/strong\u003e Designed to set a new standard for all-round flagships, POCO F8 Pro blends innovation with incredible value. Its premium exterior debuts POCO's one-piece milled glass craftsmanship and houses the powerful Snapdragon® 8 Elite chipset. An industry-leading HyperRGB AMOLED display delivers an immersive visual experience, while a 50MP telephoto lens brings precision to every shot.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOCO X8 Pro Max: \u003c/strong\u003eThe ultimate powerhouse engineered for extreme performance. Boasting POCO's largest-ever 8,500mAh (typ) silicon-carbon battery with 100W HyperCharge, it is built for users who demand long-lasting endurance. Powered by the Dimensity 9500s chipset, it delivers exceptional power and speed, enhanced by WildBoost Optimization for an unmatched gaming experience during intensive, long-term use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOCO X8 Pro: \u003c/strong\u003eAs a perfectly balanced performance flagship, it is powered by the Dimensity 8500-Ultra chipset for seamless performance. Its premium design, featuring a glass back and metal frame, combines refined craftsmanship with exceptional durability. A 6,500mAh (typ) battery with 100W HyperCharge completes the experience, delivering long-lasting power and ultra-fast charging for worry-free everyday use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAlso included in the Carnival lineup are POCO M8 Pro 5G, POCO M8 5G, and POCO C81 Pro,⁴ offering a broad range of options for fans across all segments.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrom 8 to ∞: Creating the Future Together\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBeyond exclusive offers, POCO will also launch a global fan activity on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/POCOGlobalOfficial\"\u003eFacebook\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://x.com/POCOGlobal\"\u003eX\u003c/a\u003e, bringing fans into the celebration and building excitement around POCO Carnival 2026. Fans can join the \"Complete Your ∞\" challenge by drawing the right half of POCO's \"∞\" artwork and sharing their creations with the tags @POCOGlobal and #POCOCarnival for a chance to win exclusive gifts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFor eight years, POCO Carnival has brought fans and tech enthusiasts together to celebrate high-performance innovation. As the journey continues from 8 to ∞, POCO remains committed to delivering the bold technology that powers the future. Join the celebration at \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com\u003c/a\u003e and across POCO's social media channels, or visit local e-commerce platforms for more details on exclusive offers and bundles.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹ Starting dates may vary by country and region.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e² Availability may vary by market and sales channel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³ Discounts and terms may vary by country and region. For more information, please visit your local POCO website and official social media channels.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁴ Products participating in POCO Carnival 2026 may vary by market and sales channel. Please refer to local POCO websites and participating sales channels for details.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"1269","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1786090789"},"common":null}